Despite being equipment that is tier 75 or higher, the following items may currently be used without failing the task:
* [[Holy ghrazi rapier]]
* [[Holy sanguinesti staff]]
* [[Holy Scythe of Vitur|Holy]] and [[Sanguine Scythe of Vitur]]
* [[Ancient sceptre]] with quartz attached
* [[Desert treasure 2 rings]]
* [[Max_cape#Variants|Max cape variants]] of [[Dizana's quiver]]
* [[Amulet of rancour (s)]]
* [[Echo Virtus robes]]

Lastly, dying does not disqualify the player for the task; as long as one teammate survives and completes the raid, the task is completed for all participants.

